<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA 1 IRELAND 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA 1 IRELAND 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania led Ireland 1-0 in their World Cup group four qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Adrian Ilie 32</p>
